{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234480","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1423448001:1":{"text":"아이들이 좋아할 음식을 사고 싶은데요... 이 돈으로 살 수 있는 만큼 다 주세요!","source_cn":"我想买点孩子们爱吃的食物……这些钱能买多少我就买多少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CA799C0932FF7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423448002:1":{"text":"쯧쯧, 이 돈으로는 많이 못 사요. 기껏해야 빵 두 개나 사겠네요.","source_cn":"啧啧，恕我直言，您这些钱可买不了多少，顶多只能买两块面包。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBE14410FC8C90B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423448003:1":{"text":"세상이 예전 같지 않아서, 지금 왕성에 값이 안 뛴 물건이 없으니까요!","source_cn":"世道不比以前了，现在王城里什么东西的价格不是飞涨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7008FEF05976EF41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423448004:1":{"text":"하지만 두 개로는 턱없이 부족한데... 아이들이 굉장히 많아서요...","source_cn":"可是两块根本不够……那么多孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47708CF89BA5723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423448005:1":{"text":"깊은바위 마을의 빵은 이것보다 크고 맛있었던 것 같아요. 가격도 훨씬 저렴하고요...","source_cn":"我记得深岩村出产的面包个头又大又美味，比这里要实惠得多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E75AE7E47944842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423448006:1":{"text":"제사장님! 저희가 깊은바위 마을에 가서 물어볼게요! 거기 빵이 조금 더 쌀 테니까요!","source_cn":"祭司小姐，我们可以帮你去深岩村问问！那里的面包应该会便...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC3E9ACDBE3F1BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423448007:1":{"text":"고맙습니다! 지갑은 여러분에게 맡길 테니 되도록이면 빵을 많이 사서 와주세요!","source_cn":"谢谢你们！钱袋就交给你们了，多带些面包回来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD454DF30A6F1BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:好心的祭司":{"text":"착한 제사장","source":"好心的祭司","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:精明的食品商人":{"text":"눈치 빠른 식료품 상인","source":"精明的食品商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}